    Bug 1984436 - Implement EWS Settings in Account Hub email setup manual config. r=babolivier,mkmelin


    **How to test**
    - Use the test exchange email, testaccounts@o365.thunderbird.net, to find a config
    - Select edit config on either a non-ews option or the ews exchange option
    - The protocol options should not show ews as a protocol in the option list if an imap or pop3 option was selected
    - The auth methods should all be listed if a non-ews config option was selected to edit
    - If you selected an ews config option, the only protocol shown in the protocol options should be EWS
    - The only auth methods shown should be Normal Password, OAuth, and Autodetect

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D263551

